# WARNING: HEAVY SPOILERS #

(unwritten) LORE:
    Max Lore:
        ☐ Max turns out to be a spy on the ship and Nanos right hand man
        ☐ but plans to overthrow Nano
        ☐ Max goes to find and enslave planets of other systems (using nanotechnology from his boss) for his own enjoyment
        ☐ this upsets nano -> fight
        ☐ Max wins barely
        ☐ Nano anticipated a better future if he retreated, so he let him win (knows he can't beat max completely if not at home)
        ☐ Max doesn't change until he gets to the hivemind planet
        ☐ Nano awaits him there and ends Max with the help of his home ecosystem after everything max unpreventably did

    hivemind planet:
        - all living beings on this planet are found to be one giant hivemind, and everything works as one
        - "created" nano --> final boss planet for Max

    Characters:
        god:
            - Ben Zwarm
            subpersonalities:
                (mothers x chromosomes)
                1:
                    - Ban (male form 1, Y1) (original, who was born from y chromosome of father)
                    - Bun (female form 1, X1) (as if born from x chromosome of father and personality as if raised the same way)
                    basically like twins
                2:
                    - Bin (female form 2, X2)
                    - Bon (male form 2, Y2)
            fate:
                - eventually finds someone of the same capabilities as him (subpersonality origin story)
                    - turns out it's another him he created in his sleep (he dreamt about having a friend who is on his level)
                    --> basically twins

