        random abilities planet:
            emotion sense:
                name:
                    - Nise Mono (~Impostor)
                abilities:
                    - feeling and moving emotions (later also thoughts) of anything
                    conditions:
                        - sufficient physical contact
                            - spreads like voltage / high potential spreads more easily
                    scaling:
                        - stronger emotions / thoughts can already be felt through less
                        - larger contact surface, more focused concentration and more developed skill increase flow rate & sensitivity
                fate:
                    - meeting someone with remote aura for the first time
                        - finds out she can feel emotions by just being close
                            - example: handshake hasn't connected yet, pulls back in shock
                    - meeting someone with immense aura of negative emotions
                        - gets overwhelmed by just being within line of sight
            inherit:
                name:
                    - Bake Mono (~Monster)
                abilities:
                    - applies inheritance like in blender cad
                        - all parts of the target (child) inherit a given aspect of those parts of the source (parent)
                    conditions:
                        - must physically touch (or be within trained distance of) both parent & child at activation
                        - target mass does not exceed trained limit
                    growth:
                        - maximum range of activation
                        - maximum distance of keeping inheritance active
                        - maximum mass of applicable entities
                        - duration of effect
                fate:
                    - used as a tool by a big group
                    - carries tools to best use ability
                    example moves:
                        - low level: shield inherits relative position to caster
                            - makes shield keep its location relative to the caster fixed, floating in front of him
                            - as all parts of the shield are affected, it will not even scratch when walking though walls with it
                        - mid level: enemy inherits relative position to part of the earth
                            - when that part of the earth (maybe a rock) gets lifted, the whole enemy lifts
                            - may be applied such that it only affects the average position of the enemy, so they may still fight back even though they cannot move their center of mass
                            - enemy will then float there like a wireless punching bag
                        - high level: enemy inherits relative temperature to a rock
                            - rock heats by 100°C when thrown into a furnace -> enemy heats up by 100°C, evenly
                        - catastrophic level: enemy inherits absolute temperature of liquid nitrogen (caster carries that with him just for that move)
                            - enemy immediately freezes and crumbles into pieces
                        - catastrophic level: planet inherits relative position to held rock
                            - moving the rock moves the entire planet and thus acts like an engine for the entire planet as a spaceship
                            - also controls rotation, may change the length of days this way
            enchant:
                name:
                    - Kake Desu
                abilities:
                    - can apply various enchantments to physical items
                    conditions:
                        - physical touch
                    growth:
                        - maximum mass of enchanted object
                        - maximum size of enchanted object
                        - maximum range of activation and keeping the enchant active
                        - maximum duration of keeping the enchant active
                            (depending on the level - weak enchants may be permanent when the caster is high level) 
                        - maximum intensity of enchant
                        - success rate of enchanting working
                fate:
                    - sells permanently enchanted items
                    - hosts game shows (for the amusement of the throne), special items as prizes
                    example moves:
                        - apply to crown:
                            - curse of binding: passive effect - once worn, the item cannot be taken off of the wearers body until it breaks or the wearer dies
                            - thorns: active effect - once hit, will send the same hit back at the attacker
                            - friendly fire: passive effect - reverses all active effects (inverse-thorns: once-hit, will send the same hit at the victim again; may count as another hit on level 2)
                        - apply to sword:
                            - loyalty: returns to owner after losing physical contact
                            - sharpness: sharpens itself over time with speed according to level of enchant
                            - flame: anything touched will start burning at the points of contact
            ghost:
                name:
                    - Queen Nara Sayo (means ~goodbye)
                abilities:
                    - ghost: enables noclip for caster and touch (within trained range)
                    - soul eater: tries to absorb souls of anything the caster noclips through
                        - success - grows stronger, absorbs abilities of the soul
                        - failure - gets kicked out from the soul, never to try that one again (blocked from clipping soul owner)
                    - can materialize inside the enemy and make overlapping parts of them disappear
                backstory:
                    - overthrew the old ruler
                    - kept control of the throne the longest of any ruler ever
                        - is undamagable while in ghost and deletes opponents who are too weak (basically everyone else because his power level just happens to be high)
                    throne backstory:
                        - is free to take for whoever is strong enough
                        - servants of the throne always serve the sitting ruler so they are not targeted by overthrow attempts
                            - one unnamed servant keeps trying to get money from people who enter the castle, calling it tariffic
                fate:
                    - orders a reverse game show for each one the enchanter hosts
                        (instead of winning something for winning, participants lose something for losing)
                    - overthrow attempt by enchanter
            token twins:
                name:
                    - Tama Gnocchi [m] (toke, big noodle) & Pana Gnocchi (bit)
                abilities:
                    - spends strength tokens on attack, defense & misc
                    - time based token limit:
                        - toke: refill limit at midnight
                        - bit: refill one after trainable time
                    - can train (or pass out from token exhaustion) to get higher token limit & lower regen time
                    - can use token storage box enchanted by enchant to store tokens
                    - can use token regen potion from enchant to instant refill some amount once per potion
            skizzo:
                name:
                    - Skizzo Fren
                abilities:
                    - schizoprenia + artist
                    - sees things where there are none
                    - but things he sees turn into reality
                    -- learns to control what he sees over time
            quantum particle:
                name:
                    - Saku Ritsu (quant)
                abilities:
                    - position only known when observed
                    - probability distribution of where they could be
            qbit:
                name:
                    - Para Ritsu
                abilities:
                    - can crack any code instantly (quantumly trying all combinations)
                lore:
                    - child of quant & bit
            scps:
                ban plays as scps
                096:
                    - ...
                173:
                    - ...
            but:
                name:
                    - Shikar Sci (~shikashi)
                abilities:
                    passive:
                        - anything done to him applies to the causing entity instead (even if positive)
                        - min 1 hp: can never actually die, just get very damaged (possibly beyond repair but healing is a thing)
                    active:
                        will learn this as the story goes on
                        - counter proposals with equal strength
                        (example: gravity ALWAYS pulls down -> [but] gravity DOES NOT ALWAYS pull down {either pulls another direction or does not pull at all - blocks path through spacetime to only follow time, not space})
            solid shadow:
                name:
                    - Dak Kage (~Dark Cage)
                abilities:
                    - can treat shadows as if they were solid (hitting the shadow hits the shadow-caster)
                    - anyone touched by his shadow may disappear (if intended, but accidents happen and are irreversable) [clothes fall onto the ground empty, possible powers get transferred]
            wandering dreamer:
                name:
                    - Yume Tumi (~you met me)
                abilities:
                    - can enter, manipulate and cause dreams, including physical effects and reading memories from dreams
                    - trauma dump: triggers the most traumatizing sensation to make the victim seize fighting / give up
            echo:
                name:
                    - Zoku Twida (~so gut wie da, ekko)
                abilities:
                    - echo throws a copy of the caster wherever they whistle to
                    - no way to know which copy is the real one and which is an illusion
                    - can also cast sonic weapons
                lore:
                    - behind skizzo abduction
                    - imitates queen to make skizzo hate her (using him as weapon against her)
            speak:
                name:
                    - Marh Daz (~mach das)
                abilities:
                    - commands she says get followed, no matter what
            timer:
                name:
                    - Toki Boot
                abilities:
                    - stops time to move
                        - in order to keep seeing, his eyes don't absorb photons but display what would be seen depending on the photons that are there in that instant
                        - cannot hear, because to prevent him from not being able to move through stopped air he moves the air from where he's going to where he was, but it stays still otherwise
                            - (this way he also does not make sounds when moving during time stop)
                    - may drag something else with him
                        - may also see the history of touched
                    - phoenix: if dead, rise from the ashes
                    - r3531: reset to how he was at any point in time with memories (everyone else gets returned to their original state too, just the gods are exempt but may choose to comply)
            swarm:
                name:
                    - Mita Soro
                abilities:
                    - can disassemble anything (even herself) into microscopic parts and rearrange them
            puppet:
                name:
                    - Ito Ito
                abilities:
                    - can make anything (even other people) puppets he controls (either through touch or distanced if trained enough)
                    - puppets may be returned to original, but they remember what they did (can train to make them not remember)
            complex:
                name:
                    - Isek Comp
                abilities:
                    - travels 2 spacial dimensions for each normal spacial dimension
                    (each axis is a complex plane)
                    (shadows can fall through dimensions)
                    (schizophrenia can imagine these and more dimensions)
                    (sound can travel dimensions if thrown with intent)
                    - ultimate prison (solitary confinement even): parallel planes (isekai?)
                        - can move others there
                        where no humans exist
                        animals are different
                        buildings exist, don't or are different
                        geography may even be different
                lore:
                        - is a hired mercenary
                        - signature quote "today, we have a list: ..."

    intermission:
        # skipped for now
        - story continues through bun
        - meeting with other selves in universe-cloud-subdomain or something like that
        - move to abilities planet

    abilities planet:
        - Ban & Bun walk the streets
        - stop near an alley where they overhear plans to overthrow the king
        - get attacked
        - enemies punches miss without ban dodging (redirects punches)
        - Ban says he's "kinda new to this magic thing"
        - attackers assume he has no magical ability because of low aura
        - Ban asks if strong aura can hurt low aura people? (maybe reference Rimuru Slime he read a story of [which is part of the books he had in his room on the ship])
        ... more main story
        
        Shock moment where a seemingly random passerby appears behind Bun mid conversation, grabs her head by the hair and cuts it straight off, her body collapsing to the ground after the other one of the conversation gets splashed by blood propelled by the weapon.
        Blood splurts out the fallen corpses neck in the direction of the person she talked with and out of her hanging head onto the back of her fallen body, finally coming to a stop once it touches her boots.
        The attacker tries to run away, Ban sees this in his intentions and precents him from moving at all.
        Ban weirdly does not freak out, but the conversant does, until he/she sees Ban pull a disgusted face saying "dude, why did you do that? That's weird man"
        "Really, that is weird to pull off unwarranted, just like my brother said", says Buns Head, seemingly unfazed, as her body gets back up and reattaches to her head.
        The attacker turns out to be Y2 pulling a harmful prank on his older sister.
        The situation was sealed from the public and for the conversant it looked as if he had a schizophrenic episode,
        like he was imagining that Bun was attacked, but then he returns in shock to see her completely fine, making him think it never happened.
        (even though it did and the three just hid that fact from him, making him think he's going schizo again [this goes along with his abilities as skizzo])
        Y2 then continues acting as a big brother / bodyguard.

        (at some point) Ban gets slightly angry, traps Aggressor in transparent walls encasing him with Ban, attacks on ban pointless, the witnesses then vote on his execution

        (after experiencing Toki Boot r3531) try time travel themselves
        Same timeline where if you don't mess up everything happens as you knew it did;
        if you do mess up,
        Alternate timeline where you don't affect your original timeline (and thus self)
        but if forced to be the same timeline,
        an origin paradox will continue if nothing breaks BUT impossible future paradox terminates story branch (the universe crashes)

        ... at some point,
        - Ban & Bun get access to the real world (like reverse isekai)
        - experiment with the following possibilities:
            - both stay existing through the real world
            - one [disappears / can't pass] to collapse their identity into one person
            - both [disappear / can't pass] because real world does not accept them
            && if transfer
            - keep the powers
            - can only transfer mind and not powers to control from real body
